ent-PelletShotgunSlugAP = pellet (.50)
ent-ShellShotgunSlugAP = shell (.50 AP sabot)
    .desc = A shotgun shell with an armor-piercing sabot slug. The steel penetrator rides in a plastic sabot, flies faster than a regular slug and gets through body armor, but leaves a smaller wound.
ent-BoxShotgunSlugAP = ammunition box (.50 AP sabot)
    .desc = A cardboard box of .50 shotgun shells. A shotgun shell with an armor-piercing sabot slug. The steel penetrator rides in a plastic sabot, flies faster than a regular slug and gets through body armor, but leaves a smaller wound.
ent-PelletShotgunFrag = pellet (.50)
ent-ShellShotgunFrag = shell (.50 FRAG-12)
    .desc = A FRAG-12 shotgun shell. Instead of a slug it fires a small fin-stabilized grenade that explodes on impact.
ent-BoxShotgunFrag = ammunition box (.50 FRAG-12)
    .desc = A cardboard box of .50 shotgun shells. A FRAG-12 shotgun shell. Instead of a slug it fires a small fin-stabilized grenade that explodes on impact.
ent-PelletShotgunBirdshot = pellet (.50)
ent-ShellShotgunBirdshot = shell (.50 birdshot)
    .desc = A hunting shotgun shell loaded with birdshot. A dozen light pellets in a wide cone: nasty up close, but even a light vest stops it.
ent-BoxShotgunBirdshot = ammunition box (.50 birdshot)
    .desc = A cardboard box of .50 shotgun shells. A hunting shotgun shell loaded with birdshot. A dozen light pellets in a wide cone: nasty up close, but even a light vest stops it.
ent-PelletShotgunFlechette = pellet (.50)
ent-ShellShotgunFlechette = shell (.50 flechette)
    .desc = A shotgun shell packed with flechettes. The thin steel darts fly in a tight group and get through light armor better than buckshot.
ent-BoxShotgunFlechette = ammunition box (.50 flechette)
    .desc = A cardboard box of .50 shotgun shells. A shotgun shell packed with flechettes. The thin steel darts fly in a tight group and get through light armor better than buckshot.
ent-PelletShotgunRubber = pellet (.50)
ent-ShellShotgunRubber = shell (.50 rubber buckshot)
    .desc = A shotgun shell loaded with rubber buckshot. Knocks people down and leaves bruises, but rarely kills.
ent-BoxShotgunRubber = ammunition box (.50 rubber buckshot)
    .desc = A cardboard box of .50 shotgun shells. A shotgun shell loaded with rubber buckshot. Knocks people down and leaves bruises, but rarely kills.
